+<p class="eyebrow">Research</p><h1>Research &amp; publications</h1><p class="lead">Geometric representation theory, the Langlands program, and the geometry of moduli spaces.</p>
 <section><h2>Research interests</h2><p>My interests center on Hitchin fibrations, endoscopy, and affine Springer fibers, including their role in the weighted fundamental lemma. I am also interested in singular support and characteristic cycles on affine Grassmannians in positive characteristic.</p></section>
